<title>FRANCE: S&amp;P-Adef confirms Renault ratings.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P-Adef confirms Renault ratings.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's-Adef said on Friday it confirmed S&amp;P's short-term A-2 rating and Adef's long-term A2 rating for French carmaker Renault after the announcement of its 1996 results.  </p>
<p>&quot;The confirmation of these ratings reflect, in spite of a disappointing group net loss of 5.2 billion francs in 1996, expectations by Standard &amp; Poor's that the reduction the group's production capacity, even though implementing this is difficult, should allow it to improve the balance between its production capacity and future demand,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 42 21 53 81</p>
